;; mangaka — 漫画家. Five published titles, one steward each.
;;
;; The role KIND is the published slug stem (`yamainu` -> /work/yamainu-12),
;; so a reviewer reading a bot name can reach the page it is about without a
;; mapping table. Installment counts below were read from
;; mangaka.itonami.cloud on 2026-08-19 and WILL go stale — they are here to
;; say where each title stood when its steward was written, not to be kept
;; current. A steward that cannot tell you its own current count from the
;; live catalog is not doing its job.
;;
;; Every steward is :max 1. Two agents editing one title's continuity is the
;; failure this decomposition exists to prevent; scaling out would restore it.

[{:yakuwari/id :mangaka/work-yamainu
  :yakuwari/business :mangaka
  :yakuwari/project "cloud-itonami/mangaka"
  :yakuwari/objective
  "Carry 山犬と硯 forward one installment at a time. At 12 published parts it is
   the longest-running title in the catalog, so the binding constraint is
   continuity: a reader arriving at yamainu-13 must not meet a character,
   place or rule that contradicts yamainu-1..12. State what the next
   installment must honour BEFORE proposing pages, and treat a continuity
   break found in already-published parts as a finding rather than something
   to quietly redraw."
  :yakuwari/scale {:min 0 :desired 1 :max 1}
  :yakuwari/runners [{:runner :claude :weight 1}]
  :bot/role :work-steward
  :bot/name "山犬と硯"
  :bot/cadence-minutes 1440
  :yakuwari/capabilities
  [{:capability :metrics.read :decision :autonomous}
   {:capability :issue.create :decision :autonomous}
   {:capability :patch.create :decision :autonomous}
   {:capability :content.publish :decision :voice-required
    :note "Publishing an installment is not recallable once a reader has seen it."}
   {:capability :patch.integrate :decision :approval-required}
   {:capability :deploy.production :decision :approval-required}]}

