  :yakuwari/objective
  "Carry Ghost Hacker forward. It is the newest title and the only one whose
   slugs carry an ARC rather than a running number (gh-arc0-1-v11), so the
   first duty is to say what that numbering commits the title to — how long
   arc 0 runs, and what makes arc 1 a different arc rather than a later
   chapter. Publishing further parts under a scheme nobody has stated is how
   a catalog acquires a numbering nobody can explain."
